// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
// npc: /d/xingxiu/npc/shachong.c
// Jay 3/17/96
inherit NPC;
void create()
{
        set_name("沙虫", ({ "sha chong", "chong", "bug" }) );
        set("race", "野兽");
        set("age", 3);
        set("long", "一只黄褐色的小甲虫，尾巴上有黄蓝相间的环纹。你的直觉告诉\n"
"你它一定有毒。\n");
        set("attitude", "peaceful");
        set("no_die",1);
        set("limbs", ({ "头部", "身体", "触角", "前螯", "尾巴" }) );
        set("verbs", ({ "bite", "claw" }) );
        set("combat_exp", 300);
        set_temp("apply/attack", 5);
        set_temp("apply/defense", 2);
        set_temp("apply/armor", 1);
        setup();
}
void die()
{
        object ob;
        message_vision("$N冒出一股绿水，死了。\n", this_object());
        ob = new(__DIR__"shachongke");
        ob->move(environment(this_object()));
        destruct(this_object());
}
